{"unit_id":"S3K926__dsh-selfwake#card-zh","repo":"S3K926/dsh-selfwake","commit":"4ec7c81077974bc0595e18e9fcc4276acaf2f9bf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-selfwake 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的主动对话插件。它定期检查随机间隔、用户空闲时间、未回复次数、静默时段和每日次数等条件；全部满足后，将状态与简短约束注入活跃会话，让模型现场组织消息。它可根据档案或内置话题池选择方向，把一轮消息分次投递，并持久化开口时间与未回复状态。客户端代码会自动发送排队中的自唤醒消息，并收起注入原文。需要 DSH 持续运行；未能投进活跃会话时，只有配置通知脚本才会发通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:423-463","index.js:1028-1077","index.js:1138-1388","client.js:38-92"]}
{"unit_id":"S3K926__dsh-selfwake#card-en","repo":"S3K926/dsh-selfwake","commit":"4ec7c81077974bc0595e18e9fcc4276acaf2f9bf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-selfwake adds proactive messaging to DSH web. It checks idle time, quiet hours, unanswered count, and a daily cap before injecting a prompt into an active session for the model to answer. Its client sends queued messages and hides the prompt. Notifications require a configured script.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:423-463","index.js:1028-1077","index.js:1138-1388","client.js:38-92"]}
